{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116850","id":3336379044,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7G3Rqk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116850","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116850.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116850.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116850","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116850/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116850/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116850/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4c8b5f960f3d276c7e218b0830f2324915f8425e","number":116850,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[TextEdit] Fix clipping of last character due to right margin rounding","user":{"login":"CarrotOfPower","id":260066004,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4BK1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260066004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower","html_url":"https://github.com/CarrotOfPower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes an off-by-one clipping issue introduced in commit 1794098.\r\nUsing ceil() on the right margin reduces the visible text area by up to 1 px,\r\ncausing the last character of long lines to be clipped.\r\n\r\nThis restores the previous behavior by using floor() for SIDE_RIGHT while\r\nkeeping ceil() for SIDE_LEFT.\r\n\r\n- Fixes #110577.\r\n\r\nSee also:\r\n-  #114221\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110791\r\n\r\nThis pull request resolves the issue without affecting other behavior: it only adjusts the one extra pixel needed at the end of `TextEdit` on custom scales so the last character is visible again. Probably using floats is a proper solution (#114221), but if that is not planned in the near future, this is a simple, low-risk improvement to the currently severely impacted usability.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin